---
export const prerender = true;

import '@fontsource-variable/archivo';
import '@fontsource/anton';

const instagramUrl = 'https://www.instagram.com/trovatemi.it/';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090a" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Hai clienti felici. Fai in modo che si veda. Trovatemi mette al lavoro il passaparola che hai già."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://trovatemi.it/" />
    <title>Trovatemi.it — Il passaparola che hai già. Messo al lavoro.</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <header class="topbar">
          <a class="brand" href="/">TROVATEMI.IT <span>★</span></a>
          <a class="ig-link" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@trovatemi.it ↗</a>
        </header>

        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="kicker">IL PASSAPAROLA CHE HAI GIÀ. MESSO AL LAVORO.</p>

          <h1>
            HAI CLIENTI<br />
            FELICI.<br />
            <mark>FAI IN MODO<br />CHE SI VEDA.</mark>
          </h1>

          <p class="lead">
            Ogni giorno qualcuno ti fa un complimento, torna, ti consiglia.
            Il problema è che troppo spesso quella prova finisce lì.
          </p>

          <a class="cta cta-yellow" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            SCRIVICI SU INSTAGRAM <span>→</span>
          </a>
          <small>Mandaci solo il nome della tua attività.</small>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
          <img src="/images/hero-local-business.webp" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
          <div class="shade"></div>

          <div class="quote-card">
            <span>CLIENTE</span>
            <p>“Mi sono trovata benissimo.”</p>
          </div>

          <div class="reply-bubble">Grazie ❤️</div>

          <div class="sequence">
            <span>PAGA.</span>
            <span>ESCE.</span>
            <span>FINE.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="google-note">PECCATO CHE<br />GOOGLE NON ERA LÌ.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bridge">
        <p>Quello che i clienti dicono di te</p>
        <strong>È GIÀ IL TUO MARKETING.</strong>
        <span>Deve solo smettere di sparire.</span>
      </section>

      <section class="system">
        <header class="system-head">
          <p class="kicker">DA CLIENTE FELICE A PROVA VISIBILE.</p>
          <h2>NON CREIAMO<br />IL PASSAPAROLA.<br /><mark>LO METTIAMO AL LAVORO.</mark></h2>
        </header>

        <div class="steps">
          <article class="step step-photo">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <div class="step-media">
              <img src="/images/nfc-review-counter-v7.webp" alt="Supporto Trovatemi per chiedere una recensione" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <div class="step-copy">
              <h3>RACCOGLI</h3>
              <p>Il cliente è contento. Gli rendi semplice lasciare una traccia che resta.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="step step-reply">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <div class="step-media reply-scene">
              <div class="review-card">
                <small>RECENSIONE</small>
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <p>“Servizio fantastico. Tornerò sicuramente.”</p>
              </div>
              <div class="owner-reply">
                Grazie di cuore.<br />
                Ti aspettiamo presto. 💛
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-copy">
              <h3>RISPONDI</h3>
              <p>Una recensione non resta un monologo. Diventa relazione, cura e fiducia.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="step step-social">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <div class="step-media social-scene">
              <div class="social-card">
                <div class="social-brand">TROVATEMI.IT <span>★</span></div>
                <blockquote>“Finalmente qualcuno che ascolta davvero.”</blockquote>
                <div class="yellow-stroke"></div>
                <small>PROVA REALE. FATTA LAVORARE.</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-copy">
              <h3>FALLA LAVORARE</h3>
              <p>Le parole migliori smettono di vivere in un solo posto e diventano prova visibile.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="close">
        <div class="close-copy">
          <p class="kicker">TROVATEMI.IT ★</p>
          <h2>
            PIÙ PROVE.<br />
            PIÙ FIDUCIA.<br />
            <mark>PIÙ SCELTE.</mark>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="close-action">
          <p>
            Non ti serve un altro “piano marketing”.<br />
            Parti da quello che i clienti stanno già dicendo.
          </p>

          <a class="cta cta-white" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            SCRIVICI SU INSTAGRAM <span>→</span>
          </a>

          <small>Mandaci il nome della tua attività. Ti rispondiamo da lì.</small>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <strong>TROVATEMI.IT <span>★</span></strong>
        <p>IL PASSAPAROLA CHE HAI GIÀ. MESSO AL LAVORO.</p>
        <small>Non promettiamo posizioni. Non filtriamo recensioni.</small>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --black: #08090a;
    --yellow: #f2bd18;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --paper: #f4f1e9;
    --muted: #a3a39d;
    --ink-muted: #65655f;
    --line-dark: #2a2b2d;
    --line-light: #d9d5ca;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html {
    background: var(--black);
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--paper);
    font-family: "Archivo Variable", Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  img { display: block; width: 100%; }

  ::selection {
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--yellow);
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    min-height: 100svh;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(420px, .88fr);
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--black);
  }

  .topbar {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 10;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 76px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 60px);
  }

  .brand,
  footer strong {
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.85rem);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: .015em;
  }

  .brand span,
  footer strong span {
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .ig-link {
    color: #d8d8d3;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: .03em;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 130px clamp(24px, 5vw, 78px) 72px;
  }

  .kicker {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--yellow);
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  h1,
  .system h2,
  .close h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .004em;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    font-size: clamp(4.8rem, 8.6vw, 9.3rem);
    line-height: .84;
  }

  mark {
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--yellow);
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    padding: 0 .07em .05em;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 28px 0 28px;
    color: #d0d0ca;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    min-height: 58px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: .015em;
  }

  .cta span { font-size: 1.4rem; }

  .cta-yellow {
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--yellow);
  }

  .hero-copy > small,
  .close-action > small {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #858580;
    font-size: .68rem;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100svh;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1b1c1d;
  }

  .hero-visual > img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .shade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.05), rgba(0,0,0,.62)),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.35), transparent 35%);
  }

  .quote-card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24%;
    left: 7%;
    max-width: 340px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .quote-card span {
    color: #777770;
    font-size: .58rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .quote-card p {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .reply-bubble {
    position: absolute;
    top: 39%;
    left: 25%;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    color: var(--black);
    background: #c7f3a4;
    font-size: .9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }

  .sequence {
    position: absolute;
    left: 7%;
    bottom: 24%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .sequence span {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.65);
    padding: .5rem .65rem;
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .google-note {
    position: absolute;
    left: 6%;
    bottom: 7%;
    max-width: 500px;
    padding: .5rem .75rem .65rem;
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--yellow);
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 4.8vw, 5.1rem);
    line-height: .88;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  }

  .bridge {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.2fr .8fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 155px;
    padding: 28px clamp(20px, 5vw, 78px);
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .bridge p,
  .bridge span {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: .8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .bridge strong {
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: .95;
  }

  .bridge span {
    justify-self: end;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .system {
    padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 130px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 78px);
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .system-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .55fr) minmax(0, 1.45fr);
    gap: clamp(34px, 7vw, 110px);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: clamp(42px, 6vw, 76px);
  }

  .system-head .kicker {
    align-self: start;
    color: #8b6b00;
  }

  .system h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
    font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 6.8vw, 7.2rem);
    line-height: .88;
  }

  .system h2 mark {
    display: inline;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--black);
    background: var(--black);
  }

  .step {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .step-number {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 5;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    display: grid;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--yellow);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .step-media {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #ddd;
  }

  .step-media > img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .step-copy {
    min-height: 170px;
    padding: 22px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3.2vw, 3.3rem);
    line-height: .95;
  }

  .step-copy p {
    max-width: 31ch;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: .82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .reply-scene {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 28px;
    background: #ecebe6;
  }

  .review-card {
    border: 1px solid #d5d2c9;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }

  .review-card small {
    color: #797972;
    font-size: .56rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .stars {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #e6ac00;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }

  .review-card p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: .8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .owner-reply {
    justify-self: end;
    width: 82%;
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    color: var(--black);
    background: #c7f3a4;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .social-scene {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--black);
  }

  .social-card {
    width: min(100%, 300px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 22px;
    color: var(--white);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 15%, rgba(242,189,24,.14), transparent 30%),
      #111214;
    border: 1px solid #333436;
  }

  .social-brand {
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .social-brand span { color: var(--yellow); }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Anton", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    line-height: .95;
  }

  .yellow-stroke {
    width: 68%;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--yellow);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }

  .social-card small {
    color: #989892;
    font-size: .55rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .close {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(300px, .85fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 120px);
    align-items: end;
    padding: clamp(75px, 10vw, 150px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 78px);
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--black);
  }

  .close .kicker { color: var(--yellow); }

  .close h2 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    font-size: clamp(4.4rem, 8vw, 8.6rem);
    line-height: .85;
  }

  .close-action {
    padding-bottom: .5rem;
  }

  .close-action > p {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: #c7c7c2;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .cta-white {
    color: var(--black);
    background: var(--white);
  }

  footer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 92px;
    padding: 20px clamp(20px, 5vw, 78px);
    color: var(--white);
    background: var(--black);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }

  footer p,
  footer small {
    margin: 0;
    color: #858580;
    font-size: .62rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  footer small {
    justify-self: end;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      min-height: 720px;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      min-height: 720px;
    }

    .bridge,
    .system-head,
    .close {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .bridge span {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, .9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    }

    .step-media {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      min-height: 360px;
    }

    .step-copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 360px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .topbar {
      min-height: 64px;
      padding-inline: 16px;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 110px 18px 58px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(4.1rem, 20vw, 6rem);
    }

    .hero-visual {
      min-height: 620px;
    }

    .quote-card {
      top: 12%;
      left: 18px;
      right: 18px;
    }

    .reply-bubble {
      top: 29%;
      left: 70px;
    }

    .sequence {
      left: 18px;
      bottom: 25%;
    }

    .google-note {
      left: 18px;
      right: 18px;
      bottom: 6%;
      font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 14vw, 4.4rem);
    }

    .bridge,
    .system,
    .close,
    footer {
      padding-inline: 18px;
    }

    .bridge {
      gap: 10px;
      padding-block: 30px;
    }

    .system-head {
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .system h2,
    .close h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 17vw, 5.6rem);
    }

    .step {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step-media {
      min-height: 330px;
    }

    .step-copy {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .close {
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .cta {
      width: 100%;
    }

    footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding-block: 24px;
    }

    footer small {
      justify-self: start;
    }
  }
</style>
